==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|heill}} (compare {{cog|fo|heilur}}, Norwegian Nynorsk {{m|nn|heil}} Norwegian Bokmål, Danish, and Swedish {{m|da|hel}}), from {{der|is|gem-pro|*hailaz}} (compare {{cog|en|whole}}, {{m|en|hale}}, {{cog|nl|heel}}, {{cog|de|heil}}), from {{der|is|ine-pro|*kóh₂ilus||healthy, whole}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/heitl/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|eitl|s=1}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|heilli|heilastur}}

# [[healthy]]
